course: dictionary
lesson: 7552
title: Pregnancy and growing up
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Pregnancy is the time when a woman or a female animal has a baby growing inside her body. It is one stage in the life cycle, the way living things grow, change and have young. You can say «a pregnancy» or talk about «pregnancy» in general.
explain: The length of a pregnancy depends on the animal. In humans it lasts about nine months. A cat's pregnancy lasts about two months, and an elephant's lasts almost two years. The sentence tells you that pregnancy is about living things, not about a job or a test.
explain: Context helps you guess the meaning of phrases. «A healthy pregnancy» is one where things are going well for the mother and baby. «Baby bump» means a belly that clearly shows a pregnancy, so you can guess it is a word about the body.
fact: Pregnancy means the time when a woman or a female animal has a baby growing inside her body.
fact: In humans, pregnancy lasts about nine months.
fact: Pregnancy length is different for different animals: a cat about two months, an elephant almost two years.
fact: «Baby bump» means a belly that clearly shows a pregnancy.
fact: A pregnancy is private until the people involved choose to share it. A guess from a photo is not a fact.
exercise: In humans, about how long does a pregnancy last? | About nine days | About nine weeks | *About nine months | About nine years
exercise: What does «baby bump» mean? | A type of bedtime story | A game played at school | *A belly that clearly shows a pregnancy | A toy for a baby
exercise: «A pregnancy is private until the people themselves choose to share it.» What does private mean here? | Given to everyone at school | Easy to see from far away | *Not shared with others unless the people choose | Very loud and noisy
test: Which word means the time when a woman or a female animal has a baby growing inside her body? | Holiday | Life cycle | Birthday | *Pregnancy
test: Ruby reads «a healthy pregnancy» and asks what it means. Which is the best answer? | A pregnancy that is very short | A pregnancy that happens in a hospital bed | *A pregnancy where things are going well for the mother and baby | A pregnancy that nobody can see
exam: Which has the longer pregnancy, a cat or an elephant? | They are the same length | *An elephant | A cat | A human
